== found by the mutation probe while building it
the epoch-start torch-RNG restore survived while every test loader had an explicit generator (the sampler then never draws from the global RNG) -> tests without a loader generator added, mutant killed
a buffer sync before the distributed mid-epoch save was an equivalent mutant (EMA buffers never feed back into training, DDP overwrites model buffers at every forward under broadcast_buffers=True) -> removed; under broadcast_buffers=False the rank's own buffers are now recorded instead (review finding 1)
the .sampler generator path survived: with auto-batching batch_sampler.sampler is the same object, so only batch_size=None needs it -> unbatched test added, mutant killed; a first batch-sampler mutant only renamed the key (equivalent) -> replaced by one that drops the generator
